  ↓
Alice = [5, 6, 7]
  ↓
Create Bob List
  ↓
Read 3 values
  ↓
Bob = [3, 6, 10]
  ↓
compareTriplets(a, b)
  ↓
Create scores list
  ↓
Alice_score = 0
Bob_score = 0
  ↓
i = 0
  ↓
5 > 3 ?
  ↓
YES
  ↓
Alice_score = 1
  ↓
i = 1
  ↓
6 > 6 ? NO
6 < 6 ? NO
  ↓
Nobody gets point
  ↓
i = 2
  ↓
7 > 10 ? NO
7 < 10 ? YES
  ↓
Bob_score = 1
  ↓
